e actions\n\n**Completion criteria:**\n- `uvicorn app.main:app --reload` starts without errors\n- `/health/db` returns `{\"status\": \"connected\", \"database\": \"kezza_rewards_db\"}`\n- All routes in `mobile.py` and `admin.py` have real implementations (no `raise NotImplementedError` or placeholder `return {}`)\n- OTP flow end-to-end: request → verify → activate → token refresh\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2 — Mobile Auth Screens\n**Goal:** Auth flow (login → OTP → activate) is complete with all states.\n\n**Tasks:**\n- P2-T1: `login.tsx` — proper form validation, loading state, error display\n- P2-T2: `verify.tsx` — 6-digit OTP input, auto-submit on 6th digit, resend with cooldown, error states, dev_code display banner\n- P2-T3: `register.tsx` (invitation activation) — full name + invitation code, validation, success navigation\n- P2-T4: `(auth)/_layout.tsx` — proper stack config\n- P2-T5: `auth-store.ts` — hydrate/persist review, token rotation handled\n\n**Completion criteria:** Full auth flow navigable on simulator; all error branches shown.\n\n---\n\n### Phase 3 — Mobile Core Tabs\n**Goal:** All 4 tabs have complete implementations with all states.\n\n**Tasks:**\n- P3-T1: `(tabs)/index.tsx` (Home) — stats, cycle progress, quick actions, recent referrals — all states complete\n- P3-T2: `(tabs)/patients.tsx` — searchable referral list, status filter, loading/empty/error/populated states\n- P3-T3: `(tabs)/payments.tsx` — payment claims list, status badges, all states\n- P3-T4: `(tabs)/wallet.tsx` — points balance, ledger entries, cycle progress, indicative value label\n- P3-T5: `(tabs)/_layout.tsx` — tab bar with proper icons and labels (Home, Patients, Claims, Rewards)\n- P3-T6: hooks in `features/referrals/hooks.ts`, `features/payments/hooks.ts`, `features/wallet/hooks.ts` — all query hooks implemented\n\n**Completion criteria:** All 4 tabs load real data from API (or graceful empty state if DB is empty). No TypeScript errors.\n\n---\n\n### Phase 4 — Mobile Task Screen